WEBVTT

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:32.470
Did you find anything good?

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:34.650
Ah, no...

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:36.950
I don't think there's anything really good.

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:38.680
How about around here?

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:41.030
Oh, that looks good!

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:43.250
There's more to come, so...

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:44.470
Fufu...

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:45.790
At the Cultural Festival, we, the five-year group, will give out...

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:48.960
Cakes!

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:54.170
If you're a member of our club, please help us when you're free!

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:57.250
Let's all liven up the Cultural Festival!

00:02:57.250 --> 00:02:58.130
Yeah!

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:26.470
I'll teach you how to do it while doing makeup on the roof with the research announcement of the history that we talked about with everyone yesterday.

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.100
If you like, please come.

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:35.280
As for the research announcement, it's okay if Minori is the main one, right?

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:37.350
Leave it to me.

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:42.420
I'm not good at being in front of people, so I'm going to take care of the background.

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:44.820
The rest is the makeup class.

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:50.930
Don't you want a cute mirror or dresser?

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:55.570
It's like the customer's mood goes up while doing makeup.

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:57.220
Wow, that might be nice.

00:03:57.220 --> 00:03:59.280
But what exactly are you going to do?

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:03.030
What do you think of this?

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:05.080
What is this? I can make it myself?

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:07.020
So cute!

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:08.990
It's so cute!

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:23.030
It doesn't cost much, huh?

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:24.460
It's a good start.

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:27.800
I'm on leave, so you can go with everyone.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:30.000
I want to read it as soon as possible.

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:32.950
Got it. Let's go, everyone.

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:35.560
Okay, go go!

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:51.540
It's not bad, but it's easier in the water, isn't it?

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:56.020
Chosetsu!

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:07.390
That's something I wrote a long time ago, and now I've already quit the Literature department.

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:10.700
Is this a diary? Or is it...

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:14.980
If I see anything more than this, I won't let it go!

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:35.010
"Culture Festival" is like a school festival.

00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:37.410
It's really a festival.

00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:38.180
Laura!

00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:40.680
Kocchi Kocchi!

00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:55.080
It's fun, isn't it?

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.880
It's Yukki!

00:05:56.880 --> 00:06:00.000
Then, let's have a game of "Ikayaki" again this year.

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:02.620
It's the tradition of our judo club.

00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:06.790
On the day of the event, we will promote our squid costume.

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:09.300
That's right, Senpai. Actually...

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:12.590
Crab? Crab?

00:06:12.590 --> 00:06:16.650
What are you going to do? Our restaurant is a grilled squid!

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:19.860
It seems that we have received a double reservation.

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:25.980
The person inside will send it for free, so please endure it with the crab costume.

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:30.000
Oh, well. We are in the same company.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.440
That was a close call.

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:39.570
Head-streaming!

00:06:39.570 --> 00:06:42.760
I'm going to stream it at school on the day after tomorrow.

00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:44.810
If you're interested, please watch it.

00:06:44.810 --> 00:06:52.060
I want to do a live broadcast of the Tropical Club's Aozora Makeup Class on the same day.

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:58.160
I want someone to do a perfect make-up and show it off.

00:06:58.160 --> 00:06:59.310
What do you think?

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:06.440
Then, can you tell that to Ikizawa-senpai and Ichinose-san as well?

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:16.960
You're always so energetic.

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:19.720
Well, that's Manatsu Torie after all.

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:21.890
Oh, that place is...

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:25.550
Um, it's the Literature Club.

00:07:25.550 --> 00:07:29.320
They're planning to distribute the magazines they made.

00:07:35.340 --> 00:07:38.320
Izumi was in the same class as Minori last year?

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:40.570
That's right, but why?

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:44.760
Then do you know why Minori dropped out of the literature club?

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:49.110
What's wrong with you suddenly, Lola?

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:53.940
You know, there was a doll novel that Minori was writing in the literature club, right?

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:58.120
Minori was watching that last time.

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:00.000
And now I'm bored.

00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:05.870
I read books when I have time, and I got lost when I joined the Tropical Club.

00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:11.190
Actually, I want to write a novel again in the Literature Club.

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:12.320
What?

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:15.660
So, how is it? Do you know?

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:22.770
Yes. I'm still a reader, as always.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:29.700
Ms. Ichinose, she joined the Literature Club as soon as she entered school last year.

00:08:31.050 --> 00:08:35.970
Every day, every day, I remember writing a novel that looked really fun.

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:43.000
I also read the novel, but I thought it was really interesting.

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:52.650
However, one day I stopped writing it, and when I heard it, I quit the literature club.

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:56.460
I couldn't ask for a reason, so I didn't ask.

00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:58.420
That's all I know.

00:08:58.420 --> 00:09:00.000
I'm sorry.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:23.200
On the 42nd floor of Aozora Middle School, a cultural festival will be held.

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:35.380
Now for the research announcement!

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:39.440
If you like this, come here!

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:50.770
Is this a festival?

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:53.750
You're full of motivation, aren't you?

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:56.660
Then, let's go with this guy right away!

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:58.580
Here you go!

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:07.470
The base is the key point.

00:10:07.470 --> 00:10:09.600
Even if you just put on make-up,

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:11.890
your impression will change considerably.

00:10:11.890 --> 00:10:13.890
Thank you very much.

00:10:13.890 --> 00:10:17.660
Also, this dresser is very cute, isn't it?

00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:19.620
It is handmade.

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:21.820
It is also exhibited in the room,

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:24.010
so please take a look if you like.

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:24.770
Yes!

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:32.190
Damn it, where did he go?

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:34.270
I should find him as soon as possible.

00:10:34.270 --> 00:10:36.270
Ah, there he is!

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:38.100
Our water is over here!

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:40.100
Hey, what are you doing!

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:44.930
It's delicious crepe!

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:52.430
He suddenly came!

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:12.550
We'll take care of this.

00:11:12.550 --> 00:11:13.690
Go on.

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:16.800
Asuka-senpai, but...

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:22.160
Please help Sangou to get out of the classroom.

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:23.910
Minori-senpai...

00:11:31.340 --> 00:11:35.320
Yes, what is it?

00:11:35.320 --> 00:11:42.360
Mr. Ichinose, it's about time for the live broadcast, are you okay?

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:46.400
Oh, it's the promised time.

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:48.500
But I'm in trouble.

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:50.640
Everyone can't let go of their hands now.

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:53.300
It's very popular.

00:11:53.300 --> 00:12:00.000
It seems that the reputation of the customer is good, so I would like to ask you about it.

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:05.790
Hmm, but I can't leave this to one of the three of us.

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:08.020
That's right.

00:12:08.020 --> 00:12:09.000
I'm sorry.

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:12.370
Unfortunately, this time...

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:13.990
I got it.

00:12:13.990 --> 00:12:15.180
I'll go out.

00:12:15.180 --> 00:12:17.600
Minori?

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:19.330
It's okay.

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:20.380
Wait a minute.

00:12:32.970 --> 00:12:35.030
Don't make a fool of yourself! Get out of here!

00:12:35.030 --> 00:12:36.400
P-Please!

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:37.240
Ora!

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:39.030
Ora, ora, ora, ora, ora!

00:12:39.030 --> 00:12:40.440
Ryaaah!

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:42.520
You're such a pain in the ass!

00:12:42.520 --> 00:12:45.960
Heh.

00:12:45.960 --> 00:12:53.290
You can't stay quiet if you don't cook enough seafood.

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:56.400
Be careful.

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:58.130
Oraaaah!

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:00.000
Ryaaah!

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:02.660
Hello!

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:04.840
I'm Nobunka Saisho.

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:07.260
Next, I'd like to introduce

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:11.090
the "Tropical Club" that has "Aozora Makeup Classroom" on the roof.

00:13:11.090 --> 00:13:13.560
It's very popular, isn't it?

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:15.110
Thank you very much.

00:13:15.110 --> 00:13:16.520
Eh?

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:17.400
That's...

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:23.920
I'd like to talk to Minori Ichinose, the 2nd year member of the Tropical Club.

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:30.000
She's a cute dresser.

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:31.740
Did you make it by yourself?

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:35.730
Yes, I made it with the help of all the members.

00:13:35.730 --> 00:13:37.860
It was very fun.

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:39.350
Michinose-san...

00:13:39.350 --> 00:13:42.860
And this is the makeup room, right?

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:46.680
Yes, you can actually experience the makeup.

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:49.090
Mama...

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:53.740
Hmm...

00:13:53.740 --> 00:13:56.280
Oh?

00:13:56.280 --> 00:14:00.000
The Blue Sky Makeup Classroom is the first class.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.250
It's being held on the stage.

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:04.920
If you'd like, please come and see it.

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:06.520
Thank you very much.

00:14:06.520 --> 00:14:08.770
It was Mr. Ichinose of the Tropical Club.

00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:26.140
This is what I've been waiting for.

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:27.960
I've been waiting for you!

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:29.890
I'll be waiting for you!

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:01.090
- -

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:44.880
Himeku Tokodakueiku Flute!

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:48.720
Cure Papaya!

00:15:48.720 --> 00:15:50.720
Hatameku Tsubasa!

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:55.340
Cure Flamingo!

00:15:55.340 --> 00:15:56.650
Fuosha!

00:15:56.650 --> 00:15:58.260
Cure La Meri!

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:32.530
YARUKI POWER, Bakken!

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:26.110
Are you confident again as soon as you get here?

00:18:26.110 --> 00:18:30.000
It's okay.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.640
It will soon be over.

00:18:32.640 --> 00:18:34.610
This is not an earthquake.

00:18:34.610 --> 00:18:40.400
The witch of Atomawashi is possessed by a nightmare.

00:18:40.400 --> 00:18:44.510
This is also because the motivation power does not gather at all.

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:46.430
Hey, hey, sorry.

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:48.880
We are doing it as it is.

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:54.120
It is meaningless if there is no result.

00:18:54.120 --> 00:18:55.480
As it is.

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:19.770
Everyone...

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:23.780
Hey, Minori, why did you quit the Literature Club?

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:44.170
Ever since I was a child, I've always loved reading stories and having various fantasies.

00:19:44.170 --> 00:19:53.770
That's why in junior high school, I joined the literature club and wrote a proper novel for the first time for a magazine to be published at a cultural festival.

00:19:53.770 --> 00:19:59.030
When it was completed, I thought I did it. It's a masterpiece.

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:03.720
It was well-received by the friends in the class who read it.

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:07.290
So when I went to see Buno-senpai,

00:20:07.290 --> 00:20:11.880
"You should apply for the show right away. You'll be able to become a professional."

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:14.720
They might have said that.

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:19.220
But it's easy to describe.

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:24.690
The characters and the story itself are all borrowed from somewhere I've read.

00:20:24.690 --> 00:20:29.320
There's nothing that I've experienced.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:31.920
"This is a very valuable story"

00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:35.790
"That's not true!"

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:38.790
"That story was very exciting!"

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:39.700
"Thank you"

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:44.710
"But when I read it again, the excitement was gone"

00:20:44.710 --> 00:20:47.660
"What Senpai said was all true"

00:20:47.660 --> 00:20:54.150
"I was just wondering why I didn't notice"

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:57.120
"I was so confident that I was embarrassed"

00:20:57.120 --> 00:20:59.420
"My ears turned red"

00:20:59.420 --> 00:21:00.000
"But still"

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:06.000
Since that day, I couldn't write a single line anymore.

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:20.040
Reading books has always been fun, but I've been spending days like that that still can't satisfy me.

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:26.690
But then, that feeling changed when I met everyone.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:36.520
When I entered the Tropical Club, I tried to do things that I thought were important at that time.

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:44.650
Even if I wasn't interested in it until now, I realized that there were a lot of fun things to do.

00:21:44.650 --> 00:21:49.230
Today's make-up and interview were also very interesting.

00:21:49.230 --> 00:21:53.690
I was nervous and my heart was about to explode.

00:21:53.690 --> 00:21:58.090
Really? I didn't look like that at all.

00:21:58.090 --> 00:22:00.000
I'll use Lola as a reference.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:25.190
That's why I'm really having so much fun right now, thanks to everyone, thank you.

00:24:01.600 --> 00:24:02.760
What's wrong, Kururun?

00:24:02.760 --> 00:24:04.020
The heat is a problem!

00:24:04.020 --> 00:24:05.320
Let's go, everyone!

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:08.080
Tropicalouge Precure!

00:24:08.080 --> 00:24:09.670
The Legend of Revival!

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:11.330
Precure Omekashi Up!
